{"id":"n63967-1-8","stage":2,"title":"손목시계 · 手表","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63967-1-8-1","ko":"지금 몇 시야?","zh":"现在几点？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"시야?","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시야","audio":"/audio/c30f56ae00dca78e3875.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]}],"audio":"/audio/adcdb9e9ff1f93702a3a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63967-1-8-2","ko":"어머, 약이 다 닳았는지 손목시계의 바늘이 멈췄어.","zh":"哎呀，手表指针停了，可能电池没电了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"약이","meaning":"电池","explanation":"약：电池；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"5","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약이","audio":"/audio/d49452f84b8035dfa3f1.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全、都（用尽）","explanation":"다 닳다：全部耗尽、用完；原句推测电池是否用尽，不能将 다 只解释成快要。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"닳았는지","meaning":"耗完，用尽","explanation":"닳다：耗完，用尽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"닳다","audio":"/audio/5c386e3250158aff8a8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44167","senseId":"3","lemma":"닳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닳았는지","audio":"/audio/9e964e4cd073a21f12e7.mp3"}},{"text":"손목시계의","meaning":"手表","explanation":"손목시계：手表；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"손목시계","audio":"/audio/05983d95a725f5128633.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63967","senseId":"1","lemma":"손목시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손목시계의","audio":"/audio/bfbed0023a4984d9b65e.mp3"}},{"text":"바늘이","meaning":"针，表针","explanation":"바늘：针，表针；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바늘","audio":"/audio/ed9978c1cc17e3c1e57a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56388","senseId":"2","lemma":"바늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바늘이","audio":"/audio/f08d5ce4a0c970c522e0.mp3"}},{"text":"멈췄어.","meaning":"停","explanation":"멈추다：停；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"3","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfac